        "original_id": "d3cb9d21-4e98-5237-b324-89875790581d",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Ukraine, Sochi, Russia\n- Events: 2014 Winter Olympics\n- People: Oksana Baiul\n- Topics: Ukraine at the 2014 Winter Olympics, Winter Olympics medals, figure skating\n\nFacts:\n- Ukraine competed at the 2014 Winter Olympics in Sochi, Russia, from 7 to 23 February 2014.\n- The women's relay victory at the 2014 Winter Olympics gave Ukraine its second Winter Games gold medal ever.\n- Oksana Baiul was born on November 16, 1977, and she is a Ukrainian former competitive figure skater.\n- Oksana Baiul won the World Championship in ladies' singles in 1993.\n- Oksana Baiul won the Olympic title in ladies' singles in 1994.",
